{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 09:51:19 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent-DocUpdate] [Project: documentation_update] Architectural decision: Preserve historical changelog sections rather than delete. v2.1.1 section in README renamed to 'History: Update v2.1.1' rather than removed. Rationale: Users may reference historical versions for troubleshooting or understanding evolution. Constraint: Document structure preserved where possible. | constraint=format_preservation; decision=preserve_history; reasoning={\"how\": \"Mark sections clearly as 'History' prefix, preserving content while signaling it's not current\", \"what\": \"Alternative was complete removal of v2.1.1 sections. Rejected because it loses audit trail and may confuse users who found references to v2.1.1 features.\", \"why\": \"Historical documentation has value for troubleshooting and understanding system evolution\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/documentation_update/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T09:51:19.765621+00:00_45494379", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T09:51:19.765662+00:00"}
